---
title: "invest (LegionFixedPriceSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_paused: check not paused
    q_check_paused --> q_revert_paused: contract paused
    q_revert_paused --> [*]: revert ContractPaused
    q_check_paused --> q_check_window: not paused
    q_check_window --> q_in_prefund: prefundStartTime <= block.timestamp <= prefundEndTime
    q_check_window --> q_in_active: startTime <= block.timestamp <= endTime
    q_check_window --> q_revert_window: outside both windows
    q_revert_window --> [*]: revert SaleNotActive
    q_in_prefund --> q_verify_sig: in prefund period
    q_in_active --> q_verify_sig: in active sale period
    q_verify_sig --> q_check_amount: signature valid (authorized signer)
    q_verify_sig --> q_revert_sig: invalid signature
    q_revert_sig --> [*]: revert InvalidSignature
    q_check_amount --> q_transfer: amount >= minimumInvestAmount
    q_check_amount --> q_revert_amount: amount < minimumInvestAmount
    q_revert_amount --> [*]: revert BelowMinimumInvestment
    q_transfer --> q_update_state: transferFrom(investor, address(this), amount)
    q_update_state --> q_emit: investorPosition.totalInvested += amount AND totalCapitalInvested += amount
    q_emit --> [*]: emit Invested(investor, amount)

    note right of q_verify_sig
        INV-001: Investment only accepted during prefund or active sale windows
        INV-002: Every invest call requires valid signature from authorized signer
        INV-003: totalCapitalInvested increases monotonically during sale
        INV-004: bidToken balance of contract >= totalCapitalInvested - refunded
    end note
